B.bBo=new A.mb(B.Jf,B.ab1,"How Net GST Payable is Calculated","Net GST Payable = Output GST (Sales) \u2212 Input GST (Purchases / ITC)\n\nComponent-wise:\n\u2022 Net IGST = Sales IGST \u2212 Purchase IGST\n\u2022 Net CGST = Sales CGST \u2212 Purchase CGST\n\u2022 Net SGST = Sales SGST \u2212 Purchase SGST\n\nNegative means ITC > output tax for that slab \u2014 the excess can offset other components per GST rules.\n\nSummary card = period only. GST Reconciliation Combined row adds the opening carry-fwd for the full picture.")
